        _root_.LowDimensionalTopology.Geometry.Hyperbolic.hSLIsometry (_root_.LowDimensionalTopology.Geometry.Hyperbolic.axisHalfTurnSL (u*t) (mul_pos (lt_trans zero_lt_one hu)
